s 'Oldan (marg. gr. kai Lobnan. oion deb. kai. Lobnan . B. after Deb. kai 'Oldan adds h Lobnan ) It does not appear who is meant by this Lobna, unless it originates in some strange misconception of 2 Kings xxiii. 31, \"daughter of Jeremiah of Libnah,\" LXX. Q. 9I. ek Lobna . Clem. Alex. Str. i. §. 136. has no such name in his list of Old Testament prophetesses."},{"id":"0e51fdd68e79","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_act","w":"chrysostomus.hom_act","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":45,"p":[4,4],"r":[4,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings iv. 10"},{"id":"4c2a322360bc","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_1co","w":"chrysostomus.hom_1co","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":4,"p":[14,14],"r":[6,5],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings chapter 6, verse 5-2"},{"id":"662c910cdebb","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_1co","w":"chrysostomus.hom_1co","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":9,"p":[25,25],"r":[8,13],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings chapter 8, verse 13"},{"id":"c4776c75f4f7","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_1co","w":"chrysostomus.hom_1co","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":15,"p":[11,11],"r":[5,26],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings chapter 5, verse 26"},{"id":"63786013ff21","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_2co","w":"chrysostomus.hom_2co","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":23,"p":[34,34],"r":[5,20],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings chapter 5, verse 20"},{"id":"08d7574d3ab2","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_eph","w":"chrysostomus.hom_eph","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":9,"p":[4,4],"r":[6,8,6,12],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings vi: 8-12"},{"id":"6b4d30900c07","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_eph","w":"chrysostomus.hom_eph","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":9,"p":[5,5],"r":[6,13],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Kings vi: 13"},{"id":"abf8a49dfa7d","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.hom_eph","w":"chrysostomus.hom_eph","a":"johannes_c